{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund mandatory offer of bereavement support for all who experience baby loss",
        "additional_details": "We call on the Government to fund a mandatory offer of bereavement support/referral for support at the first instance within the environment that the loss happened, hospital, EPAU, private clinics etc. We think this will provide every person who have experienced such loss with the option of receiving support.",
        "background": "We would like the Government to fund a mandatory offer of bereavement support/referral for support to families and individuals who have experienced any form of baby loss, miscarriage or stillbirth. Families and Individuals should then have the option for further support.",
